---
// MembershipCalculatorV2.astro - Interactive Trial & Enrollment Calculator
---

<section id="cotizador" class="py-20 lg:py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-[#03131e] relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto" data-calculator>
    
    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div data-section-heading class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-500/15 border border-teal-400/30 text-teal-300 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        <span>HERRAMIENTA INTERACTIVA DE MATRÍCULA</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-athletic text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        COTIZADOR INTERACTIVO <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-300 via-teal-400 to-cyan-200">& CLASE GRATIS</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="font-sans text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Personaliza tu programa de entrenamiento en 3 simples pasos y asegura tu vacante para la clase de evaluación sin costo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Calculator Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-8 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Left: Step Selectors (7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 sm:space-y-8 bg-[#041a29] border border-teal-500/20 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl">
        
        <!-- Step 1: Age Group -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-extrabold text-teal-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2.5 sm:mb-3">
            PASO 1: ELIGE TU CATEGORÍA DE EDAD
          </label>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-2.5" role="group" aria-label="Grupo de Edad">
            <button 
              type="button" 
              data-calc-age="infantil"
              aria-pressed="false"
              class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/90 text-slate-300 text-left hover:border-teal-500/40 transition-all cursor-pointer font-sans"
            >
              <span class="block text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">6 a 11 Años</span>
              <span class="block text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white mt-0.5">Semillero Infantil</span>
            </button>
            <button 
              type="button" 
              data-calc-age="juvenil"
              aria-pressed="true"
              class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-teal-400 bg-teal-600 text-white text-left shadow-md shadow-teal-600/30 transition-all cursor-pointer font-sans"
            >
              <span class="block text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-teal-100 uppercase tracking-wider">12 a 17 Años</span>
              <span class="block text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white mt-0.5">Juveniles</span>
            </button>
            <button 
              type="button" 
              data-calc-age="adulto"
              aria-pressed="false"
              class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/90 text-slate-300 text-left hover:border-teal-500/40 transition-all cursor-pointer font-sans"
            >
              <span class="block text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">18+ Años</span>
              <span class="block text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white mt-0.5">Adultos / Mayores</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2: Training Frequency -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-extrabold text-teal-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2.5 sm:mb-3">
            PASO 2: ELIGE LA FRECUENCIA SEMANAL
          </label>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-2.5" role="group" aria-label="Frecuencia de Entrenamiento">
            <button 
              type="button" 
              data-calc-freq="2x"
              aria-pressed="false"
              class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/90 text-slate-300 text-left hover:border-teal-500/40 transition-all cursor-pointer font-sans"
            >
              <span class="block text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">2 Días / Semana</span>
              <span class="block text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white mt-0.5">Pack Básico</span>
            </button>
            <button 
              type="button" 
              data-calc-freq="3x"
              aria-pressed="true"
              class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-teal-400 bg-teal-600 text-white text-left shadow-md shadow-teal-600/30 transition-all cursor-pointer font-sans"
            >
              <span class="block text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-teal-100 uppercase tracking-wider">3 Días / Semana</span>
              <span class="block text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white mt-0.5">Pack Pro (Recomendado)</span>
            </button>
            <button 
              type="button" 
              data-calc-freq="weekend"
              aria-pressed="false"
              class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/90 text-slate-300 text-left hover:border-teal-500/40 transition-all cursor-pointer font-sans"
            >
              <span class="block text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Sábados & Domingos</span>
              <span class="block text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white mt-0.5">Pack Fin de Semana</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3: Current Skill Level -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-extrabold text-teal-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2.5 sm:mb-3">
            PASO 3: ¿TIENES EXPERIENCIA PREVIA EN VOLEIBOL?
          </label>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-2.5" role="group" aria-label="Nivel de Experiencia">
            <button 
              type="button" 
              data-calc-level="principiante"
              aria-pressed="false"
              class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/90 text-slate-300 text-left hover:border-teal-500/40 transition-all cursor-pointer font-sans"
            >
              <span class="block text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Desde Cero</span>
              <span class="block text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white mt-0.5">Principiante</span>
            </button>
            <button 
              type="button" 
              data-calc-level="intermedio"
              aria-pressed="true"
              class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-teal-400 bg-teal-600 text-white text-left shadow-md shadow-teal-600/30 transition-all cursor-pointer font-sans"
            >
              <span class="block text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-teal-100 uppercase tracking-wider">Fundamentos</span>
              <span class="block text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white mt-0.5">Intermedio</span>
            </button>
            <button 
              type="button" 
              data-calc-level="avanzado"
              aria-pressed="false"
              class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/90 text-slate-300 text-left hover:border-teal-500/40 transition-all cursor-pointer font-sans"
            >
              <span class="block text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Partidos / Clubes</span>
              <span class="block text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white mt-0.5">Avanzado / Roce</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right: Calculated Plan Card (5 cols) in Ocean Navy / Teal -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between bg-gradient-to-b from-[#072b43] to-[#041a29] border-2 border-teal-500/40 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl relative">
        <div class="absolute -top-3 right-4 sm:right-6 px-3 sm:px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-500 text-slate-950 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider shadow-lg">
          PROPUESTA SUGERIDA
        </div>

        <div>
          <!-- Plan Header -->
          <span data-plan-tag class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-extrabold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 font-sans">
            Nivel: Intermedio (Con fundamentos)
          </span>
          <h3 data-plan-title class="font-athletic text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-2">
            Programa Menores y Juveniles • 3 sesiones x semana
          </h3>
          <p data-plan-hours class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-teal-300 mb-5 sm:mb-6 font-sans">
            5 a 6 horas semanales de pista + preparación física
          </p>

          <!-- Free Trial Badge -->
          <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-teal-500/15 border border-teal-500/30 mb-5 sm:mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 sm:w-6 sm:h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-black text-teal-300 uppercase tracking-wider block">
                ¡1RA CLASE DE PRUEBA 100% GRATIS!
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-sans">
                Asiste a una sesión completa sin ningún compromiso de pago.
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Benefits Included -->
          <div class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-2.5 mb-6 sm:mb-8">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">
              Qué incluye tu membresía en Domus:
            </span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 font-sans">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Entrenadores con titulación técnica y experiencia federada</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 font-sans">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Cancha techada reglamentaria en Jesús María</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 font-sans">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Balones de competición y material táctico profesional</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 font-sans">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Acceso a torneos internos y partidos amistosos</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- WhatsApp Pre-filled Action Button -->
        <a 
          data-calc-cta
          href="https://wa.me/51979833360?text=Hola%20Domus%20Voley,%20quiero%20reservar%20mi%20clase%20gratis"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full py-3.5 sm:py-4 px-5 sm:px-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 to-emerald-400 hover:from-teal-400 hover:to-emerald-300 text-slate-950 font-sans font-black text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-center transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl shadow-teal-500/30 hover:shadow-teal-500/50 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center gap-2 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-teal-400/50"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 sm:w-5 sm:h-5 text-slate-950" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Confirmar Reserva por WhatsApp</span>
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
